n layer.</h1><p>Business events become in-app alerts automatically. Email, WhatsApp and SMS remain provider-safe: disabled, manual handoff, or a configured server-side webhook relay.</p><div class="os-status-row"><span class="os-chip good">IN-APP LIVE</span><span class="os-chip"><?= (int)($m['open_events']??0) ?> open events</span><span class="os-chip"><?= (int)($m['unread']??0) ?> unread</span><span class="os-chip"><?= (int)($m['outbox_waiting']??0) ?> outbox waiting</span></div></section><?php if($error):?><div class="pp-alert bad"><?=comm_step21_h($error)?></div><?php endif;?><?php if($msg):?><div class="pp-alert good"><?=comm_step21_h($msg)?></div><?php endif;?><section class="s10-kpis"><div class="s10-kpi"><small>Open Events</small><strong><?= (int)($m['open_events']??0) ?></strong><span>current operational signals</span></div><div class="s10-kpi"><small>Critical</small><strong><?= (int)($m['critical_events']??0) ?></strong><span>priority attention</span></div><div class="s10-kpi"><small>My Unread</small><strong><?= (int)($m['unread']??0) ?></strong><span>in-app notifications</span></div><div class="s10-kpi"><small>Failed Outbox</small><strong><?= (int)($m['failed']??0) ?></strong><span>retry or provider review</span></div><div class="s10-kpi"><small>Sent / 30d</small><strong><?= (int)($m['sent_30d']??0) ?></strong><span>audited external messages</span></div></section><section class="s10-grid"><article class="s10-card s10-span-8"><div class="os-title-row"><div><h2>Open Operational Events</h2><p>Resolved source conditions are closed automatically on the next sync.</p></div><form method="post"><button class="os-btn" type="submit">Sync now</button></form></div><div class="os-links"><?php if(!$events):?><div class="pp-empty">No open communication events right now.</div><?php endif;?><?php foreach($events as $e):?><a class="os-link" href="<?=comm_step21_h($e['action_url']?:'communication_history.php')?>"><div><b><?=comm_step21_h($e['title'])?></b><span><?=comm_step21_h($e['body'])?> • <?=comm_step21_h(strtoupper((string)$e['severity']))?></span></div><span>→</span></a><?php endforeach;?></div></article><article class="s10-card s10-span-4"><h2>Channel Readiness</h2><p>Secrets are read only from server environment variables.</p><div class="pp-list"><?php foreach($channels as $c):$rt=$c['runtime'];?><div class="pp-source"><div><b><?=comm_step21_h(strtoupper((string)$c['channel']))?></b><small><?=comm_step21_h((string)$c['provider_mode'])?><?php if($c['channel']!=='in_app'&&$c['provider_mode']==='webhook'):?> • URL <?= $rt['url_configured']?'ready':'missing' ?><?php endif;?></small></div><span class="pp-badge <?=((int)$c['is_enabled']===1)?'':'warn'?>"><?=((int)$c['is_enabled']===1)?'READY':'OFF'?></span></div><?php endforeach;?></div></article></section><div class="os-footer-note"><strong>Delivery truth:</strong> opening WhatsApp/email manually does not prove delivery; manual items become Sent only after an authorized user marks them sent. Webhook mode records every provider attempt.</div></main></div></body></html>